+// AirPods advertise several times a second while out of the case or with the lid open, so a
+// 10 s window catches them. Each window still costs a burst of D-Bus traffic (every device in
+// range is re-added, then dropped again by BlueZ once discovery stops), so windows are spaced
+// five minutes apart. This only runs while the control link is down; startScan() opens a
+// window at once on disconnect and on resume.
+static constexpr int scanWindowMs = 10000;
+static constexpr int scanPauseMs = 290000;
